==Match==
===Summary===
In the 59th minute, [[Benjamin Pavard]] got the only goal of the game when he shot into an empty net from six yards out after the ball came to him when [[Robert Lewandowski]] challenged for a ball in the air with Tigres UANL goalkeeper [[Nahuel Guzmán]]. The goal was reviewed by [[Video assistant referee|VAR]] for an offside before eventually being awarded.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.theguardian.com/football/2021/feb/11/bayern-beat-tigres-in-club-world-cup-final-to-earn-sixth-trophy-in-nine-months|title=Bayern beat Tigres in Club World Cup final to earn sixth trophy in nine months|date=11 February 2021|work=Guardian|accessdate=10 February 2022}}</ref> 

